#: ../../introduction/index.rst:2 363ee94fb24e4b2b81bcd95cc3d83c81
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "介绍"

#: ../../introduction/index.rst:4 bd3acb00b6f44bea851b5fbdc75a442f
msgid "The package has three main public entry points:"
msgstr "该软件包有三个主要的公共入口："

#: ../../introduction/index.rst:6 b201098c4a76475a8953207dbeab4fd0
msgid "``InfoClient``"
msgstr "``InfoClient``"

#: ../../introduction/index.rst:7 56c2354ed5a345109a6d39541486316f
msgid ""
"Credential-free reads, market metadata, prices, orders, fills, portfolio,"
" staking, vault, and deployment information."
msgstr "无需凭据的读取，以及市场元数据、价格、订单、成交、投资组合、staking、vault 和部署信息。"

#: ../../introduction/index.rst:10 efa68cf3428b4ba6b53a166eaa3a9a20
msgid "``AsyncHyperliquid``"
msgstr "``AsyncHyperliquid``"

#: ../../introduction/index.rst:11 a8b5d0c76f4d40e6a7e07d0549713b45
msgid ""
"The lifecycle owner for authenticated use. It combines ``.info`` and "
"``.exchange`` and implements workflows that must resolve market metadata,"
" prices, or positions before signing."
msgstr ""
"用于已认证使用的生命周期管理者。它结合 ``.info`` 和 ``.exchange``，并实现必须在签名之前"
"解析市场元数据、价格或持仓的工作流。"

#: ../../introduction/index.rst:15 b36a0d63f6244aad88f592e5fff083cb
msgid "``ExchangeClient``"
msgstr "``ExchangeClient``"

#: ../../introduction/index.rst:16 0a3a2e0a09ff41fc89906b32baa7f567
msgid ""
"Available as ``client.exchange``. It exposes Info-independent signed "
"actions such as transfers and account administration. Applications "
"normally create ``AsyncHyperliquid`` rather than constructing it "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"可通过 ``client.exchange`` 使用。它提供独立于 Info 的已签名操作，例如转账和账户管理。"
"应用程序通常创建 ``AsyncHyperliquid``，而不是直接构造它。"

#: ../../introduction/index.rst:20 1e963d597fa046f69bca6e04083aa7fd
msgid ""
"All network I/O is asynchronous. Constructors do not allocate an HTTP "
"session; ``open()`` or an async context manager does. The client never "
"automatically retries a signed action."
msgstr ""
"所有网络 I/O 均为异步。构造函数不会分配 HTTP 会话；``open()`` 或异步上下文管理器会分配。"
"客户端绝不自动重试已签名操作。"

#: ../../introduction/index.rst:25 820d9e663abe485a820cc9154145dd47
msgid "Choosing a client"
msgstr "选择客户端"

#: ../../introduction/index.rst:27 c64a6e1a246a4a4e80ec432a3942103e
msgid ""
"Use ``InfoClient`` whenever no signed action is needed. It requires "
"neither an account address nor a private key. Account-specific Info "
"methods accept the address to query."
msgstr ""
"无需已签名操作时，应使用 ``InfoClient``。它既不需要账户地址，也不需要私钥。"
"特定账户的 Info 方法接受要查询的地址。"

#: ../../introduction/index.rst:31 2fac90ef171240f39ebc395c1c5f5699
msgid ""
"Use ``AsyncHyperliquid`` only when the process must sign. Keep the "
"signing key in a secret store, prefer an API wallet with narrowly scoped "
"funds, and begin on testnet. The ``account_address`` identifies the main "
"account while ``signing_key`` may belong to its approved API wallet."
msgstr ""
"仅当进程必须签名时才使用 ``AsyncHyperliquid``。请将签名密钥保存在机密存储中，优先使用"
"资金范围受限的 API wallet，并从 testnet 开始。``account_address`` 标识 main account，而"
"``signing_key`` 可以属于其获批准的 API wallet。"

#: ../../introduction/index.rst:36 433d7130959a4933946a9f5cc353fcff
msgid ""
"The package root intentionally exports only ``AsyncHyperliquid``, "
"``InfoClient``, and ``HyperliquidError``. Commands and enums are in "
"``async_hyperliquid.types``; detailed wire response types are in "
"``async_hyperliquid.types.info`` and "
"``async_hyperliquid.types.exchange``."
msgstr ""
"软件包根有意只导出 ``AsyncHyperliquid``、``InfoClient`` 和 ``HyperliquidError``。"
"命令和枚举位于 ``async_hyperliquid.types``；详细的 wire 响应类型位于 "
"``async_hyperliquid.types.info`` 和 ``async_hyperliquid.types.exchange``。"
